#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:205
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Supabase deliberately avoids shadows. In a dark-"
"mode-native design, shadows are nearly invisible and serve no purpose. "
"Instead, depth is communicated through a sophisticated border hierarchy —"
" from `#242424` (barely visible) through `#2e2e2e` (standard) to "
"`#393939` (prominent). The green accent border (`rgba(62, 207, 142, "
"0.3)`) at 30% opacity is the \"elevated\" state — the brand color itself "
"becomes the depth signal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:207
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:209
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:210
msgid ""
"Use near-black backgrounds (`#0f0f0f`, `#171717`) — depth comes from the "
"gray border hierarchy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:211
msgid ""
"Apply Supabase green (`#3ecf8e`, `#00c573`) sparingly — it's an identity "
"marker, not a decoration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:212
msgid ""
"Use Circular at weight 400 for nearly everything — 500 only for buttons "
"and nav"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:213
msgid ""
"Set hero text to 1.00 line-height — the zero-leading is the typographic "
"signature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:214
msgid ""
"Create depth through border color differences (`#242424` → `#2e2e2e` → "
"`#363636`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:215
msgid "Use pill shape (9999px) exclusively for primary CTAs and tabs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:216
msgid "Employ HSL-based colors with alpha for translucent layering effects"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:217
msgid "Use Source Code Pro uppercase labels for developer-context markers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:219
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:220
msgid ""
"Don't add box-shadows — they're invisible on dark backgrounds and break "
"the border-defined depth system"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:221
msgid "Don't use bold (700) text weight — the system uses 400 and 500 only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:222
msgid ""
"Don't apply green to backgrounds or large surfaces — it's for borders, "
"links, and small accents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:223
msgid ""
"Don't use warm colors (crimson, orange) as primary design elements — they"
" exist as semantic tokens for states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:224
msgid "Don't increase hero line-height above 1.00 — the density is intentional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:225
msgid ""
"Don't use large border radius (16px+) on buttons — pills (9999px) or "
"standard (6px), nothing in between"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:226
msgid ""
"Don't lighten the background above `#171717` for primary surfaces — the "
"darkness is structural"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_supabase.md:227
msgid ""
"Don't forget the translucent borders — `rgba` border colors are the "
"layering mechanism"
msgstr ""

